---
const metrics = [
  { n: '+38%', l: 'active patients retained' },
  { n: '2.4x', l: 'referrals per patient' },
  { n: '4.9', l: 'average Google rating' },
]
---
<section class="bg-cream-50 py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-8xl px-5 sm:px-8">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.05fr] lg:items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow text-teal-700">Practice story</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-heading text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.6vw,2.9rem)] font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-tight text-ink-900 text-balance">
          A three-chair practice that stopped chasing patients.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-600">
          Northside Dental was losing roughly one in five new patients after the first visit. They put aftercare in their own app, rewarded check-ins, and let referrals happen on their own.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-600">
          Within two quarters the practice was retaining far more of the patients it already had, and new patients started arriving through people they had treated.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          {metrics.map((m) => (
            <div>
              <p class="font-heading text-3xl font-semibold text-teal-700">{m.n}</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-[13px] leading-snug text-ink-500">{m.l}</p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <figure class="card-white p-8 sm:p-10">
        <div class="flex gap-1 text-teal-500" aria-hidden="true">
          {Array.from({ length: 5 }).map(() => (<span>★</span>))}
        </div>
        <blockquote class="mt-6 font-heading text-2xl font-medium leading-snug tracking-tight text-ink-900">
          "We used to treat aftercare as paperwork. Now it is the reason patients come back and the reason they send us their family."
        </blockquote>
        <figcaption class="mt-7 flex items-center gap-3 border-t border-cream-200 pt-6">
          <span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-teal-100 font-heading text-sm font-semibold text-teal-800">RC</span>
          <span>
            <span class="block text-sm font-semibold text-ink-900">Dr. Rachel Cohen</span>
            <span class="block text-xs text-ink-500">Northside Dental, 2 locations</span>
          </span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
